  │ Welcome to DHI — one-time setup                                          │
  │                                                                          │
  │ DHI keeps its own pinned tools, so every project builds the same way.    │
  │ Nothing touches your system and no sudo is used.                         │
  │                                                                          │
  │   git   version control                                         2.0 MB   │
  │   go    Go compiler and tools                                  68.3 MB   │
  │   gh    GitHub CLI                                             14.2 MB   │
  │   node  JavaScript runtime                                     52.2 MB   │
  │   rg    fast code search                                        1.8 MB   │
  │   uv    Python package manager                                 18.5 MB   │
  │   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
  │   total download                                              157.0 MB   │
  │                                                                          │
  │ installs under ~/.local/share/dhi/toolchain ·                            │
  │ remove that folder to uninstall                                          │
  │                                                                          │
  │ enter install · esc skip (capabilities refuse until installed)           │
